Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 15:42:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] The user does visual critique; designer only specs, with
 the user (organism-infra/182)

User, 2026-10-07: designer cells cost about 2.5M tokens over 24 runs, so the
user does all visual critique until a cheaper automated critique exists.

- orchestrator: UI relay is designer spec (with the user) -> qa specify ->
  developer -> qa verify -> user visual critique (ready-for-human) ->
  risk-check -> PR. No designer review or critique dispatch on the relay.
  Asset tickets: the user critiques in place of designer critique mode.
- designer: spec mode is collaborative with low-cost static visuals for
  sign-off; review and critique modes are off the relay.
- CLAUDE.md: matches.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
